== CANON-14, CANON-19 (change std-strings): Replicate a negative number of
== times.
Use Std.StrUtils

Main :
    S := "héllo"
    PutLn("before")
    N := -1
    PutLn(Replicate(S, N))
    PutLn("not reached")
;
